<title>USA: US Airways appoints VP for express division.</title>
<headline>US Airways appoints VP for express division.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>US Airways appointed John Selvaggio as vice president of its Express division.</p>
<p>Selvaggio has worked in the airline industry for over 29 years, most recently as president and chief executive officer of Midway Airlines Corp.</p>
<p>He takes over from Keith Houk, who has been named to the new post of vice president of special projects.</p>
<p>Both will report to company president Rakesh Gangwal. - Reuters Air Cargo Newsroom Tel+44 171 542 7706 Fax+5017</p>
</text>
